# Rumble Arena: "Vigilance. When this land enters, scry 1. {T}: Add {C}." (CR 702.20, 701.22). Bot1 plays the Arena and sends the
# Lightning Bolt it looks at to the bottom, so Black Lotus is now on top and Counterspell next; the land has Vigilance (a
# keyword of the land itself, which matters once it is a creature) and its {T} adds one colorless mana.

[Bot1 Deck]
Rumble Arena
Island x6
Lightning Bolt
Black Lotus
Counterspell

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Rumble Arena.Play
Bot1.Arrange( | Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Battlefield.Rumble Arena.Activate(Ability: Add {C})
? Bot1.Mana = {C}
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Library = Black Lotus; Counterspell; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield.Rumble Arena.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Rumble Arena.Keywords = Vigilance
